In article <1992Apr15.171822.12331@noose.ecn.purdue.edu> kavuri@lips2.ecn.purdue.edu (Surya N Kavuri ) writes:
>
>  (Q3) I have (a) speed boots (b) boots of levitation 
>      (c) ring of levitation (d) +3 ring of inc damage
>       (e) ring of teleport control.
>      I can teleport at will.
>
>       Should I choose (a, c, e) or (b, d, e) ?
>       Also, since I lost my telepathy, is it worth the
>       giving up one of the rings to wear ring of see inviz ?
>

( a, c, e ) is definitely the better choice from my point of view.
rings of increase damage ( as well as protection, see invisible, protection
from shape changers, and probably others I can't think of at the moment ) are
something(s) I usually only keep as long as it takes to identify/sell/polymorph
them ( and if something has to be dropped, they go first ) You can only keep
2 rings, and there are alot better choices than these.

having telepathy does not allow you to see invisible critters, unless of course
you are blinded, so dump the RoSI and if you have a wish, go for the
Helm of Telepathy ( an extremely nice little item, this )
If you want to get the See Invisibility intrinsic, just drink from every
fountain you come across as often as you can....

>      I have a WoW. Should I ask for (1) RoR (2) RoConflict

Hard choice...  Go for the helmet mentioned above, you'll probably find both
of these rings eventually.


